WEBVTT

20:01.567 --> 20:04.735
-Golly bob howdy!
-Oh, shut up!

20:04.820 --> 20:05.820
You know, in a couple of days,

20:05.904 --> 20:08.239
everything will be just the way
it was. They'll see.

20:08.991 --> 20:09.991
They'll see.

20:11.326 --> 20:13.452
I'm still Andy's favourite toy.

20:14.163 --> 20:16.831
I was on top of the world
livin' high

20:16.915 --> 20:18.916
It was right in my pocket

20:21.170 --> 20:22.879
I was livin' the life

20:22.963 --> 20:26.340
Things were just the way
they should be

20:28.218 --> 20:30.887
When from out of the sky
like a bomb
